@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health

### Current elevator state
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/elevators

### External request using the assignment payload
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/requests
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "EXTERNAL",
  "floor": 4,
  "direction": "UP"
}

### External request using the dedicated endpoint
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/requests/external
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "floor": 10,
  "direction": "DOWN"
}

### Internal request from elevator A
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/elevators/A/requests
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "destinationFloor": 9
}

### Hardware/simulator telemetry update
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/elevators/A/telemetry
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currentFloor": 2,
  "direction": "UP",
  "doorStatus": "CLOSED",
  "stops": [6]
}

### Recent events
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/events?limit=20

### Reset system
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/reset
